+
+                  /* A descriptor-shaped pair is only a candidate until its format is decoded. Report whether
+                   * its base currently belongs to a live BO; this distinguishes a plausible resource from a
+                   * stale or nonsensical address without relying on the address-reuse-prone freed-range ring. */
+                  static unsigned said_candidates;
